host_about:
Hi, I'm Chiky Gomez and Majo Cabrerizo. We are tattoo artist, not a smoker, We love sport, We practic Surfing, Skateboarding, Snowboarding and Crossfit I have a lovely family with whom I usually travel for work around the world 
You can visit my Insta profile:
@chikygomeztattoo

Open-minded musician (classical guitar, singing), interested in arts, pedagogy, authenticity, culture, good music (classical, opera, traditional, jazz, salsa..) ;), but also in beaches, and friendly people! Teacher in superior conservatories, performer;
in love with cats ;)
my moto :  "Flowers everywhere, for who can see them" Henri Matisse

